OL,3,GNEWSAPolice searching for six men over
OL,4,Aanti-migrant protest
OL,5,
OL,6,FPolice have released images of six men
OL,7,Fthey want to speak to in connection
OL,8,Fwith an anti-migrant protest in
OL,9,FPortsmouth.
OL,11,FHampshire police attended Eastney
OL,12,FMarina on 6 September after hundreds of
OL,13,Fdemonstrators blocked roads in an
OL,14,Fattempt to stop coaches carrying 120
OL,15,Fmigrants, who had crossed the Channel
OL,16,Fin a dinghy, from leaving the city.
OL,23,APub: 13-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
